msgid "More themes to set a CV or a portfolio in, beside Postulo's own: one a hiring system reads cleanly and one laid out as the Europass CV is. Switched off, the themes are no longer offered, and a document set in one of them is drawn in the plain theme until it is switched on again."
msgstr "Več tem za pripravo življenjepisa ali portfelja poleg Postulovih lastnih: ena, ki jo sistem za zaposlovanje bere čisto, in ena, razporejena kot življenjepis Europass. Ko so izklopljene, teme niso več na voljo, dokument, pripravljen v eni od njih, pa se nariše v preprosti temi, dokler jih spet ne vklopite."

